# Ignore raw data CSVs, but preserve benchmark results in results/
*.csv
!results/*.csv
!results/**/*.csv

# Manuscript source files and drafts (kept locally, excluded from public repo)
# `paper/*` (not `paper/`) so that the exceptions below work: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is ignored.
paper/*
!paper/figures/
!paper/figures/*
!paper/rebuttal_letter.md
# reference-check records cited by the response letter (R1.7, R1.8)
!paper/refs_verified.bib
!paper/references_verification.md
*.zip

